<script setup>
import {Link} from '@inertiajs/vue3';import {date,modes} from '../art';defineProps({stats:Object,admin:Boolean});
const pct=(c,n)=>n?Math.round(c/n*100)+'%':'None yet';
</script><template><div v-if="stats">
<div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><strong>{{stats.active_completed}} / {{stats.bank_total}}</strong><span>MCQ coverage · current bank</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{{pct(stats.first_correct,stats.first_total)}}</strong><span>First-attempt accuracy · {{stats.first_correct}}/{{stats.first_total}}</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{{pct(stats.graded_correct,stats.graded_total)}}</strong><span>Filtered graded responses · {{stats.graded_correct}}/{{stats.graded_total}}</span></div><div class="stat"><strong>{{stats.flashcard_reviews}}</strong><span>Flashcard reviews · {{stats.flashcards_due}} rated 1 or 2</span></div></div>
<p class="muted">Coverage and flashcard totals are lifetime measures. Accuracy below follows the selected filters. Ratings do not count as correct answers. Times are shown in Asia/Manila.</p><p v-if="stats.legacy" class="notice">{{stats.legacy}} legacy results were imported. Their historical first-attempt accuracy and study time are unknown.</p>
<section class="panel"><h2>Coverage by subject</h2><div v-for="s in stats.coverage" :key="s.subject" class="coverage"><div class="row"><strong>{{s.subject}}</strong><span>{{s.completed}} / {{s.total}}</span></div><div class="meter"><i :style="{width:(s.total?s.completed/s.total*100:0)+'%'}"></i></div></div><p class="muted">Each distinct answered MCQ counts once, whether correct or incorrect.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Subject and topic performance</h2><p v-if="!stats.groups.length">No graded responses match these filters yet.</p><div v-else class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Subject / topic</th><th>Correct</th><th>Responses</th><th>Accuracy</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="g in stats.groups" :key="g.label"><td>{{g.label}}</td><td>{{g.correct}}</td><td>{{g.answered}}</td><td>{{pct(g.correct,g.answered)}} <small v-if="g.answered<5">Small sample</small></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">Includes repeated graded responses. Use the denominators when interpreting small samples.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Recent attempts</h2><p class="muted">All dates, for the selected study tool. The subject and date filters apply to accuracy above.</p><p v-if="!stats.attempts.length">Completed and unfinished rounds will appear here.</p><div class="table-wrap" v-else><table><thead><tr><th>Round</th><th>Status</th><th>Score</th><th>Active time estimate</th><th>Started</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="a in stats.attempts" :key="a.id"><td><Link v-if="!admin" :href="'/attempts/'+a.id">{{modes[a.mode]}}</Link><span v-else>{{modes[a.mode]}}</span></td><td>{{a.status.replace('_',' ')}}</td><td>{{a.score===null?'In progress':a.score+' / '+a.items_count}}</td><td>{{Math.round(a.active_seconds/60)}} min</td><td>{{date(a.created_at)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="muted">Exam scores include unanswered items. Active time uses visible-page heartbeats with a one-minute inactivity cutoff and excludes connection gaps.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Revisit these topics</h2><p class="muted">Latest missed questions across your lifetime history.</p><p v-if="!stats.review.length">No missed questions to revisit yet.</p><div v-for="q in stats.review" :key="q.id" class="row"><span>{{q.subject}} / {{q.topic}}</span><Link :href="'/library?search='+q.id">{{q.id}}</Link></div></section>
</div></template>
